WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.503
There is no audience
on the third floor.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:13.102
Candy is comfortably enjoying
Terry's performance.

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:14.472
Terry left the banquet,

00:00:14.622 --> 00:00:17.709
searching for Candy
on the dark streets.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:27.924
A moment of reunion.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.532
Terry, where are you going?

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.431
Terrius...

00:00:44.581 --> 00:00:48.036
He went looking for Candy.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.807
Candy!

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:01.155
Who is Candy?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.033
Terry, is Candy the one in your heart?

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.171
Candy...

00:01:22.349 --> 00:01:23.909
Candy!

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.584
Can...

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:30.283
Sorry!

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:32.616
What is your problem?

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:38.388
Candy is in this town!

00:01:38.538 --> 00:01:40.625
I really heard her yelling...

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:52.074
Terry, wait!

00:01:58.285 --> 00:01:59.684
Terry!

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.950
I am sure it was Candy!

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.550
How stupid of me...

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:12.859
Why didn't I see her?

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:20.797
Archie...

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:24.134
Archie!

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:25.769
Terry!

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.037
Where is Candy?

00:02:29.787 --> 00:02:32.008
We are looking for her as well.

00:02:32.158 --> 00:02:34.082
She didn't come to the banquet.

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.615
Where does she live?

00:02:37.765 --> 00:02:40.016
At Pony's Home? At the Adleys?

00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:42.385
Terry, watch your attitude!

00:02:42.535 --> 00:02:45.191
Archie, stop!

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:47.457
Annie, do you know anything?

00:02:47.607 --> 00:02:49.826
Candy...

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:51.394
She always wanted to see you.

00:02:51.574 --> 00:02:54.358
Where can I find her?

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:57.236
At St. Joanna Hospital,
in the nurses' department.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:02:59.534
Nurses' department?

00:02:59.684 --> 00:03:04.449
Candy is a trainee nurse
at St. Joanna Hospital.

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:07.344
St. Joanna Hospital...

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.050
How rude!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.753
He lost his temper!

00:03:19.006 --> 00:03:21.830
What are you doing? Let's go!

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:23.928
I am not taking you anywhere!

00:03:24.078 --> 00:03:24.982
What?

00:03:25.125 --> 00:03:29.332
I don't take people
who don't respect ladies.

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:33.011
I must go to St. Joanna Hospital.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.139
At the hospital?

00:03:34.289 --> 00:03:37.450
I am in a rush to meet someone.

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:41.212
You could have told me earlier!
We are moving!

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:46.583
Is that someone feeling alright?
The person you are going to see.

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.450
Don't worry.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.861
My carriage is the fastest in Chicago!

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:10.307
Here we are.

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:14.513
Emergency is over there.

00:04:17.057 --> 00:04:20.515
Sir, don't give up hope!

00:04:20.894 --> 00:04:22.016
Goodbye!

00:04:22.166 --> 00:04:23.254
Thank you!

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:33.263
It looks like the St. Paul Academy.

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:57.654
You have an emergency?

00:04:57.804 --> 00:04:59.988
No, I am looking for a nurse.

00:05:00.138 --> 00:05:01.891
At this hour?

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:05.931
I won't take long. Please!

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.594
I don't think so. Come tomorrow.

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:11.569
I am leaving town tomorrow.

00:05:11.719 --> 00:05:14.112
You are looking for...

00:05:14.414 --> 00:05:17.207
Candy... No, Candice White Adley.

00:05:17.357 --> 00:05:19.046
Candy?

00:05:21.888 --> 00:05:24.146
Natalie, why are you here?

00:05:24.296 --> 00:05:25.549
Franny...

00:05:25.799 --> 00:05:28.599
Isn't Candy here today?

00:05:29.099 --> 00:05:30.993
Em...

00:05:31.965 --> 00:05:34.055
He is not a patient is he?

00:05:34.205 --> 00:05:35.429
This gentleman...

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:38.093
I am looking for Candy.

00:05:38.238 --> 00:05:40.604
Candy is not here,
as you can see for yourself.

00:05:43.576 --> 00:05:47.273
She seems to have swapped shifts
with someone else.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.172
Swapped shifts...

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:51.476
Isn't she back yet?

00:05:51.718 --> 00:05:53.319
What do you think?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.453
Can I wait for her here?

00:05:58.091 --> 00:05:59.579
Please leave.

00:05:59.729 --> 00:06:01.118
Franny!

00:06:01.268 --> 00:06:02.485
It is quite late now.

00:06:02.635 --> 00:06:06.555
How can he stay here
if he is not a patient?

00:06:07.467 --> 00:06:08.592
I won't cause you any problems.

00:06:08.742 --> 00:06:10.829
You are a problem if you stay here.

00:06:11.009 --> 00:06:12.870
Please!

00:06:13.072 --> 00:06:16.041
I will call security if you don't leave.

00:06:18.045 --> 00:06:22.268
Go ahead, I am sure they will understand.

00:06:22.418 --> 00:06:26.992
As you wish, but Candy
is going to lose her job because of this.

00:06:27.253 --> 00:06:28.578
You...

00:06:28.728 --> 00:06:31.521
There is only one entrance
in the hospital...

00:06:31.758 --> 00:06:34.158
Natalie, be quiet!

00:06:34.361 --> 00:06:36.151
Please leave.

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:46.630
Candy...

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:50.573
You swapped shifts
just to see me on stage.

00:06:50.843 --> 00:06:54.040
Who is that lady with the glasses?

00:06:56.783 --> 00:06:57.872
She looks so young,

00:06:58.022 --> 00:07:00.346
but talks like an old granny.

00:07:03.056 --> 00:07:06.185
I will wait here,
this is the only entrance.

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:10.123
Trainee nurse...

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:12.394
It suits her.

00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:21.805
In London...

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:31.074
If I was a bit older,

00:07:31.224 --> 00:07:33.982
I would have taken you with me
and left the school.

00:07:40.893 --> 00:07:45.227
And we would have lived together.
Only if I was a bit older...

00:07:45.365 --> 00:07:46.930
Candy...

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:04.708
Terry, where are you?

00:08:04.858 --> 00:08:06.967
Where can I find you?

00:08:17.497 --> 00:08:22.329
I can't go on
wandering on the streets like this

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:24.692
I can't.

00:08:24.842 --> 00:08:28.399
I can't go on like this, come on, Candy!

00:08:29.242 --> 00:08:30.766
I'll go back to the hospital.

00:08:32.111 --> 00:08:33.840
A last word.

00:08:34.414 --> 00:08:38.510
Terry, you fool!
Why didn't you hear me?

00:08:42.288 --> 00:08:43.915
Susanna Marlowe.

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:47.950
She's so beautiful, so elegant!

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:52.326
If only I could be classier...

00:08:56.903 --> 00:09:00.028
Didn't you know what is going on
between Susanna and Terry?

00:09:00.178 --> 00:09:02.803
Terry has forgotten about you.

00:09:03.009 --> 00:09:05.568
That is not true!

00:09:05.718 --> 00:09:08.167
I will not believe it
unless Terry tells me himself!

00:09:08.317 --> 00:09:10.708
I won't listen to rumours.

00:09:10.858 --> 00:09:13.251
Where exactly is Terry?

00:09:14.187 --> 00:09:15.242
The hotel!

00:09:15.392 --> 00:09:19.014
He is leaving tomorrow and
he is going to stay in the hotel tonight.

00:09:19.164 --> 00:09:21.958
Why didn't I think of this earlier?

00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:43.505
This is the last one.

00:09:43.655 --> 00:09:47.009
I could have found out which
hotel they were staying?

00:09:50.957 --> 00:09:53.007
This is the last hotel.

00:10:07.774 --> 00:10:11.232
I am sorry to bother at this time...

00:10:35.902 --> 00:10:37.727
Susanna Marlowe!

00:10:37.877 --> 00:10:40.431
She looks so pretty in person!

00:10:40.807 --> 00:10:43.275
How can I help you?

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:47.067
My name is Candy.

00:10:47.817 --> 00:10:50.754
Candy! It's her!

00:10:51.384 --> 00:10:53.223
I'm going to see someone.

00:10:55.822 --> 00:11:01.556
Terry...
No, I am looking for Mr. Terrius.

00:11:02.195 --> 00:11:04.203
Not tonight, I'm afraid.

00:11:05.832 --> 00:11:08.957
He is asleep because he is very tired.

00:11:09.107 --> 00:11:10.090
But...

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:14.265
He told us not to disturb him.

00:11:15.215 --> 00:11:16.562
Him?

00:11:16.812 --> 00:11:19.142
Would you come another day?

00:11:19.378 --> 00:11:22.142
Please, let him rest.

00:11:22.815 --> 00:11:28.544
Right,
I should let Terry take his rest.

00:11:28.694 --> 00:11:29.580
I am sorry.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.177
I can't do anything for you.

00:11:31.327 --> 00:11:34.782
I am so sorry to disturb you at this time,
I will leave now.

00:11:35.495 --> 00:11:38.451
Excuse me...
Do you want me to pass any message?

00:11:38.601 --> 00:11:40.862
Something to encourage him?

00:11:41.467 --> 00:11:44.828
Encourage? Yes.
Please tell Mr. Terrius

00:11:44.978 --> 00:11:48.264
that tonight's show was really great.

00:11:48.414 --> 00:11:51.740
I hope he will become a great actor.

00:11:57.116 --> 00:11:58.976
Don't blame me, Terry.

00:11:59.126 --> 00:12:02.987
You left me behind to look for her.

00:12:08.594 --> 00:12:10.858
I am sorry, Candy.

00:12:11.163 --> 00:12:15.259
I... I like Terry too...

00:12:29.515 --> 00:12:31.915
In the end,
I still didn't get to see Candy.

00:12:35.354 --> 00:12:38.878
Candy I left a message for you
at the hospital's entrance.

00:12:39.028 --> 00:12:40.686
Come see me.

00:12:55.908 --> 00:12:57.166
Goodnight.

00:12:57.316 --> 00:12:59.640
Actually, good morning, I guess...

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.138
How could you!

00:13:05.288 --> 00:13:07.158
I can't believe you came back at this time!

00:13:07.653 --> 00:13:11.079
Sorry, I didn't do it on purpose...

00:13:11.929 --> 00:13:15.218
Candy, do you respect your job as a nurse?

00:13:15.368 --> 00:13:18.752
Please forgive me this time.

00:13:18.902 --> 00:13:22.872
If anybody finds out about this,

00:13:23.022 --> 00:13:24.629
you will be fired!

00:13:24.904 --> 00:13:26.561
I didn't...

00:13:26.711 --> 00:13:29.296
The supervisor came to check, Candy.

00:13:29.446 --> 00:13:30.300
Really?

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.066
I said you were feeling sick

00:13:32.216 --> 00:13:34.220
and you went back to take a rest.

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:36.102
Thank you, Franny!

00:13:36.252 --> 00:13:39.610
Don't take this wrong,
I was not trying to help you.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:44.210
To have a student like you
in Merry Jane Nursing School

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.917
is a shame.

00:13:46.258 --> 00:13:50.086
From now onwards,
I won't cause any troubles.

00:13:50.236 --> 00:13:51.595
Of course!

00:13:59.138 --> 00:14:02.539
I need to get dressed at once
and make up for what I have done.

00:14:22.228 --> 00:14:23.695
Thank you.

00:14:26.532 --> 00:14:29.467
I guess Candy has seen my message.

00:14:29.935 --> 00:14:31.928
She can be here anytime.

00:14:32.178 --> 00:14:35.432
He is still thinking about Candy.

00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:38.741
I find it so hard to say
anything about last night!

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.875
Terrius, have you finished eating?

00:14:43.082 --> 00:14:45.373
Yes. I would like to take a nap
before we set off.

00:14:48.688 --> 00:14:50.710
Terry didn't sleep all night

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.451
It must be because of Candy.

00:15:06.939 --> 00:15:08.894
It hurts!

00:15:09.044 --> 00:15:10.976
Come on, don't cry!

00:15:13.012 --> 00:15:16.345
It is alright,
I will make a face for you.

00:15:22.087 --> 00:15:23.752
It is not hurting anymore, is it?

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.313
That is it.

00:15:26.463 --> 00:15:28.114
Candy, it's time to take a break.

00:15:28.264 --> 00:15:29.921
Right!

00:15:30.196 --> 00:15:33.361
Don't do anything stupid again.

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:45.536
It's so tiring to stay awake overnight!

00:15:48.447 --> 00:15:50.740
You must be Miss Candy.

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:52.109
Yes.

00:15:52.259 --> 00:15:53.873
Have you seen the message?

00:15:54.023 --> 00:15:55.111
What message?

00:15:55.261 --> 00:15:59.513
A boy came to look for you at dawn.

00:15:59.663 --> 00:16:00.548
Terry?

00:16:00.798 --> 00:16:04.694
He left a message,
I have attached it on your door.

00:16:04.964 --> 00:16:06.591
On the door?

00:16:06.899 --> 00:16:08.389
I didn't see it!

00:16:13.239 --> 00:16:14.729
Here it is !

00:16:18.277 --> 00:16:21.503
Candy, I waited for you at the hospital's
entrance, but I didn't get to see you.

00:16:21.653 --> 00:16:23.737
Are you really in Chicago?

00:16:23.887 --> 00:16:25.905
I am leaving with the 12 o'clock train.

00:16:26.055 --> 00:16:28.043
I miss you so much. Terrius.

00:16:29.922 --> 00:16:31.412
Terry...

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:40.524
It's 11:30 already. I must hurry.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.965
Excuse me, please!

00:16:46.172 --> 00:16:47.730
Excuse me!

00:16:49.241 --> 00:16:50.875
Please take me to the train station!

00:16:52.578 --> 00:16:54.209
I beg you...

00:16:59.418 --> 00:17:01.613
Sorry, could you let me
take this carriage?

00:17:02.855 --> 00:17:06.256
Young lady,
you need to follow the rules!

00:17:06.725 --> 00:17:08.315
You are a nurse?

00:17:08.465 --> 00:17:09.820
Yes! I beg you!

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.220
Take me to Chicago Train Station!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:16.322
Alright, since nurses take care
of patients.

00:17:16.472 --> 00:17:18.058
Please.

00:17:18.208 --> 00:17:19.797
Thank you!

00:17:20.206 --> 00:17:21.764
Let's go!

00:17:24.944 --> 00:17:26.966
Can you get there before 12 o'clock?

00:17:27.116 --> 00:17:29.877
My carriage can't fly.

00:17:30.416 --> 00:17:31.979
Can you at least try?

00:17:32.785 --> 00:17:34.608
I will do my best.

00:17:34.858 --> 00:17:38.979
Please. I am in such as hurry
to meet someone.

00:17:55.341 --> 00:17:59.107
Terry must be looking for me!
Get out of my way!

00:17:59.778 --> 00:18:02.269
Terry, I came to see you off.

00:18:02.715 --> 00:18:03.539
Thank you.

00:18:03.689 --> 00:18:06.709
I will come see you on Broadway!
Wait for me!

00:18:10.322 --> 00:18:13.416
What happened to Candy?
Didn't she see the message?

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.592
Terrius, it is time.

00:18:19.398 --> 00:18:22.162
You are still waiting for her, Terry...

00:18:28.374 --> 00:18:29.564
Terrius!

00:18:30.509 --> 00:18:32.909
Not yet! Candy didn't come!

00:18:39.551 --> 00:18:41.075
Quick!

00:18:53.132 --> 00:18:54.809
This is not the way to the station!

00:18:55.009 --> 00:18:57.596
I can't get to the station in time.

00:19:16.255 --> 00:19:17.586
Terry...

00:19:19.792 --> 00:19:21.449
Terry, it's dangerous to stay out there.

00:19:21.599 --> 00:19:23.221
Do you want to come inside?

00:19:41.347 --> 00:19:42.676
Candy!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.855
Terry! Terry!

00:19:46.055 --> 00:19:49.519
You haven't changed at all, Candy!

00:19:50.889 --> 00:19:53.682
Terry

00:19:53.832 --> 00:19:55.084
Just like I thought!

00:19:55.234 --> 00:19:58.652
You look very nice
in the uniform, Candy!

00:19:59.064 --> 00:20:03.228
Terry!

00:20:03.936 --> 00:20:06.632
Candy is in Chicago,
she is in America just like I am.

00:20:07.206 --> 00:20:09.766
We will no longer be longing for each other
with the endless sea between us.

00:20:12.144 --> 00:20:16.072
Terry! Terry!

00:20:16.222 --> 00:20:18.149
Candy!

00:20:20.452 --> 00:20:22.477
Terry!

00:20:29.795 --> 00:20:31.660
Terry...

00:20:39.371 --> 00:20:40.927
Terry...

00:20:41.077 --> 00:20:45.534
Everything is so familiar.
You look the same.

00:20:46.979 --> 00:20:48.703
It was just a split second.

00:20:48.853 --> 00:20:52.306
Just a short moment of reunion.

00:20:53.052 --> 00:20:56.278
But Terry and Candy

00:20:56.428 --> 00:21:01.416
seemed to attach to each other
with the deepest love.
